- One notch adds {{phase6.downgrade.C_ALL_1n_d_capital|.3f}} of capital, and two notches add {{phase6.downgrade.C_ALL_2n_d_capital|.3f}}, against a budget of {{inputs.capital_budget|.2f}}.
- One notch lifts NAIC 3+ holdings to {{phase6.downgrade.C_ALL_1n_hy_after|.1f}}, above the {{inputs.limits.hy_max|.0f}} limit, because BBB− names become 3.A.

